      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "1 .  The Petitioner seeks to quash C.R. No.14 of 2023 registered at Alankar Police Station, Pune for the offences punishable under Sections 376(2), 504 and 506 of the IPC and Sessions Case No.836 of 2023 arising therefrom and pending on the file of learned Sessions Judge, Pune.\n2.",
